      "text": "<now>This Agreement starts on the date of last signature and continues for two (2) years. The obligations in this Agreement shall continue for five (5) years from the date of termination or expiry, except in relation to trade secrets, which shall be protected for as long as they remain trade secrets.</now>"






































































































































































































































